  "notes": [
    "Policy-to-criterion and evidence-to-criterion edges are intentionally derived by traversal through controls rather than stored, to avoid a second source of truth that would drift.",
    "Cross-framework mappings (NIST, ISO, CIS) live on the control records rather than here, because they are attributes of a control rather than edges in the SOC 2 knowledge graph. Revisit if cross-framework querying becomes a first-class feature."
